        field {
            name = "rx_sd_source_sel";
            desc = "Input interface source select for the RX channel
- 0x0: I2S TX0
- 0x1: I2S TX1
- 0x8: I2S RX0

Other values: reserved Note: If TX0, TX1 or TX2 is selected as the input interface source, the TX0, TX1 or TX2 data can be looped back.";
